WEBVTT

00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,040
Hi, my name is Tamara Hus and I'm a patient of Dr. Connors and I was diagnosed with breast cancer

00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:20,000
in July of 2016 and I saw several traditional oncologists and they all were telling me

00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:28,240
different treatment options. One was saying strong chemo, one was saying mild chemo and one one actually

00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:34,720
don't do the chemo at all if I didn't feel comfortable with it. So I was very, very torn and

00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:42,400
I just felt like I needed some more answers and I felt like I was

00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:50,640
you know unclear as to why this even happened to me. You know, I was young, healthy,

00:00:51,440 --> 00:01:00,880
you know, it was very, very shocking to me to hear that news that I had cancer. So I just prayed

00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:08,000
and prayed and prayed about it and I reached out to one of my very good childhood friends who

00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:15,920
her mother had passed away from breast cancer and she said her mom had done chemo. She had

00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:22,560
a recurrence and actually that was what she had passed away from. So I kind of questioned then

00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:30,240
does chemo really even work or do anything? So she told me however that she was seeing a holistic

00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:36,880
doctor. She was living in Miami, Florida and she said why don't you contact him and see if there's

00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:44,320
anything that you can do you know for treatment if he has any ideas. So I contacted him and he said

00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:54,320
he doesn't you know specifically treat just cancer and he kind of just is a more holistic

00:01:54,320 --> 00:02:01,600
type approach but he said if he were ever to get cancer or anyone in his family were to get cancer

00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:08,160
he would absolutely hands down go see Dr. Kevin Connors and he said he's out in Minnesota

00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:16,320
and he said go online you know he has a book online read his book see if it's something that you

00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:24,960
would maybe want to do. So I got onto his website I read his book and it just made so much sense to me

00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:34,320
you know treating finding the cause of the cancer instead of just treating the symptoms of the

00:02:34,320 --> 00:02:44,000
cancer and you know why did this happen to me. So I ended up going to see Dr. Connors I first did

00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:51,280
a phone consultation with him and he explained a lot of things to me. I at this point had already had

00:02:51,280 --> 00:03:00,000
a mastectomy I chose to do a mastectomy. So the the tumor was removed it was stage one grade one

00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:07,200
was not in the lymph nodes and but I just felt like I needed to do something more because

00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:15,680
I chose not to do chemotherapy so I ended up talking with Dr. Connors on the phone and he just made

00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:24,400
me feel so at peace and he made me feel comfortable with the decision that I made to not do chemo

00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:29,360
because I feel like a lot of the traditional medicine doctors just push you into that direction

00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:36,960
and you know he did tell me there's a time in a place for chemo and you know it does target fast

00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:45,840
growing tumors however in my case I had already had the tumor removed so I I just felt a connection

00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:53,680
with him and I felt really comfortable with you know not doing chemo after I talked with him but he

00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:59,440
said there are things you still need to do you know and he explained to me the genetic testing and

00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:06,080
the applied kinesiology process and I was curious myself just to know what the cause of my cancer was

00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:15,360
also so my I booked a flight and I went out there I'm from Cincinnati and I went out there to see him

00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:25,440
in November and I found out the cause of my cancer was the flu vaccine which is amazing to me because

00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:30,800
it's pushed so much and I am a physical therapist and I worked in a hospital and they made me get

00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:37,600
the flu vaccine every year which I will no longer be doing that but yeah and did the genetic testing

00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:44,080
I found out a lot of things I should and should not be eating and I just felt so comfortable

00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:52,000
after seeing him and having a decision made in the direction that I was going with my treatment

00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:58,000
and I felt very at peace with that because I was lost for so many months trying to figure out

00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:06,080
what to do and where to go with the whole treatment so yeah it's been two a little over two years now

00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:13,360
and I'm doing well I'm still sticking to my diet plan that he recommended and taking the supplements

00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:24,080
and I made a lot of lifestyle changes but yeah I feel like he he was just God sent me to him and

00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:30,400
that was the the direction I was supposed to go with my my treatment so obviously the right

00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:39,280
machine I use as well so but yeah I feel like he has so much knowledge and so much information and

00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:45,200
there's such a different world out there with alternative cancer treatment and he and I talk all

00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:52,080
the time about how wonderful it would be to have traditional medicine combined with alternative

00:05:53,280 --> 00:06:01,600
treatment how many people would benefit from that so I look at things totally differently now I don't

00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:10,560
just do whatever the doctors tell me to do in fact I don't even really see a regular doctor any more

00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:18,240
other than just like a yearly physical same thing for my children I've got two boys and I will not

00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:25,920
vaccinate them we found out some genetic testing with them as well so yeah it's just open my

00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:31,360
eyes completely and I'm so grateful for him and I'm so grateful for the decision that I made

00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:41,840
and I think anyone who is looking for just obviously the cause of their cancer or just

00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:50,240
different treatment either in combination with traditional medicine or you know separately whatever

00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:59,440
I think Dr. Conner's is is incredible and I'm blessed to have him in my life and I thank you guys for

00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:08,960
the opportunity for letting me share my story and thank you I'll be in touch soon and I hope you

00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:18,080
all have a good rest of your day thank you

